{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a long dead kingdom, a young dragon has unleashed a primordial gloom that swallows anything it touches. Your quarry lies now in the heart of the kingdom; Can you endure the monsters that lurk and halt the spread of the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your companions. Hold tight your faith. Acquire new strengths and venture into the endless night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/f0416bde3704423b12ee35e5ecb4cba2.avif?t=1764801373\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Holder of Place</i> is a roguelike auto-battler card game. Each run you are sent deeper into a strange and fading realm, where you alternate between intense combat encounters, strategic follower choices, and unpredictable event opportunities \u2014 all leading up to a final confrontation against the <i>Dragon</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you meet random casts of followers with unique traits, and must decide who to <i><strong>RECRUIT</strong></i> into your party. You <i><strong>ARRANGE</strong></i> them so that they open up different paths of synergies and strategies. You <strong><i>WATCH</i></strong> them fight waves after waves of increasingly difficult adversaries, beasts, past nemeses, and sometimes... even yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/06f15d00329ee19b57301217f7bd03e0.poster.avif?t=1764801373\" width=600 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/06f15d00329ee19b57301217f7bd03e0.webm?t=1764801373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/06f15d00329ee19b57301217f7bd03e0.mp4?t=1764801373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/33f3ed9a389f88e13406a6e5fff7153b.poster.avif?t=1764801373\" width=600 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/33f3ed9a389f88e13406a6e5fff7153b.webm?t=1764801373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/33f3ed9a389f88e13406a6e5fff7153b.mp4?t=1764801373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanderer, roam through dreadful dreams, ancient battlefield ruins, arcane cult enclaves, and beyond. Unearth darker secrets \u2014 about your past life and lost love in the kingdom, and the true origins of the Dragon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464970/extras/887647fb5bfc33365c68804aecb32d99.webp?t=1764801373\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced auto-battler gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from 150+ unique followers and trinkets\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a dark science-fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in the ever-changing Reliquary Mode</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Threads Undone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464970/a43f53ee632750d433f80036f703cb204381de2f.jpg"},{"name":"Sunken Vault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit